tollgate (#83, ADR-0005 Nachtrag): the JWT displaces auth_header, but the rest of the
header value is not left in plain text; it becomes its own finding of the generic type.
The scheme "Bearer" stays because bearer_token reads it as prefix.
Rust overwrites the whole header value with auth_header.
-- input --
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ4In0.sigfake weiterer-text
-- must_contain --
<redacted:jwt>
-- must_not_contain --
weiterer-text
eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9
-- want --
Authorization: Bearer <redacted:jwt> <redacted:api_key>
-- deviation --
overlap
